"Loose in the Crotch" hit YouTube last year, but Houston, Kevin Nealon is bringing his sharp humor to you live. Known for his dry delivery and effortless timing, Kevin dives into everyday life and current events with a style that sticks. He spent years on SNL, never breaking character, respecting the craft. Catch the legend at Houston Improv. Friday, May 22, 2026. Link in bio for tickets. Tag someone you'd bring. 

